---
import Badge from "../ui/Badge.astro";
import GradientText from "../ui/GradientText.astro";
---

<section
  id="problem"
  class="py-24 bg-void border-t border-primary/10 reveal"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div>
        <Badge text="El problema real" variant="secondary" />
        <h2
          class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-4 mb-6 font-heading leading-tight"
        >
          Lo que pasa cuando solo <GradientText>tenés redes sociales</GradientText>
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg
              >
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              El <strong class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4">81%
              de los usuarios</strong> busca en Google antes de contratar un
              servicio local.
              <span class="text-muted text-sm">Fuente: Think with Google, 2023</span>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg
              >
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Instagram muestra tus posteos a <strong class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4">~8%
              de tus seguidores</strong>. El resto no se entera de lo que publicás.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg
              >
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Tu competidor con web <strong class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4">aparece
              primero</strong> cuando alguien busca lo que vos hacés.
            </span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <span
              class="flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-error/10 border border-error/30 shrink-0 mt-0.5"
            >
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-error"
                fill="none"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
                ><path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg
              >
            </span>
            <span class="text-ivory/80 font-mono text-base leading-relaxed">
              Cada día sin web son <strong class="text-accent underline underline-offset-4">consultas
              que se van a otros</strong> y no vuelven.
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-surface rounded-3xl border border-primary/10 p-8 lg:p-10"
      >
        <div
          class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-success/10 border border-success/20 flex items-center justify-center mb-6"
        >
          <svg
            class="w-7 h-7 text-success"
            fill="none"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-ivory mb-4">
          Una web bien hecha es tu <span class="text-success">vendedor 24/7</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-muted font-mono leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Aparece cuando te buscan, explica lo que hacés, genera confianza y
          lleva al cliente directo a tu WhatsApp. Eso es lo que construyo. Y lo
          que sigue es cómo.
        </p>
        <a
          href="#process"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-medium hover:text-accent transition-colors font-mono"
        >
          Ver el proceso
          <svg
            class="w-4 h-4"
            fill="none"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            ><path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
